{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7JgwV6AaiYaoBViu1CD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Each answer changes what the summary says or how it handles a weak point a reviewer will notice.\n\n1. **How will you cover the gap between the grant and the cost?** The attorney costs $78,000 a year and the foundation pays at most $45,000, which leaves $33,000 a year. Where does that come from? Related: what's the status of the $60,000 county contract? Was it renewed this October, is it pending, or is the renewal next October? Reviewers will check whether the position can actually be funded, so the summary needs to name the source of that $33,000.\n\n2. **Is the June departure being refilled?** If that attorney is replaced from existing funds, the grant really adds a third attorney. If not, the grant would mostly keep you at two. I need to know which so the summary describes it accurately, since a reviewer could easily read it as a replacement.\n\n3. **How many more tenants a year would a third attorney serve?** Your two attorneys handled 163 cases last year, so roughly 80 each. Is that the right figure for a new hire, or would a first-year attorney take fewer? If you have a ballpark, I'll use it to show how much of the ~300 turn-aways you'd cover.\n\n4. **When would the hire start?** For example, a summer 2027 start overlapping with the departing attorney, or later.\n\n5. **What are the foundation's stated priorities or scoring criteria?** For example access to justice, underserved counties, or sustainability after the grant ends. Please also give me the clinic and county names if you want them in the summary.\n\nIf you don't know an answer, just say so and I'll write around it without guessing. One note: since you don't have a figure for tenants without a lawyer, I'll present the 58% as your clients' outcomes, not as proof that representation caused them. Reviewers at a bar foundation are likely to catch that distinction."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":413,"cache_read_input_tokens":9566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":413},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ddc51021-b2dd-4519-ad10-61036c669215","uuid":"02e2f35a-eca7-4259-a86b-a4f37c451ba8","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:20:03.932Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7JgwGwcpSSPkdLggsqU"}
